            ],
            "value": "Required for myofilament organization of the pharyngeal sarcomeres and for pharyngeal muscle contractions and hence for pharyngeal pumping (PubMed:21633109). Together with lin-8, might be required for myofilament organization in the body wall muscles (PubMed:21633109)"
          }
        ],
