                  "source": "PubMed",
                  "id": "21633109"
                }
              ],
              "value": "Colocalizes with pat-3 to dense bodies, adhesion plaques and M lines in body wall muscles. Colocalizes with deb-1 in podosome-like structures in the pharyngeal muscle. Requires unc-95 for the localization to dense bodies"
            }
